<title>SWITZERLAND: ATHLETICS-KIPKETER BREAKS MEN'S 800M WORLD RECORD.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-KIPKETER BREAKS MEN'S 800M WORLD RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenya's Wilson Kipketer broke  the world record for the men's 800 metres when he clocked an unofficial time of one minute 41.24 seconds at the Zurich grand prix meeting on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It beat the record of 1:41.73 set by Britain's Sebastian Coe in the Italian city of Florence in June 1981 and equalled by Kipketer in Stockholm on July 7.  </p>
<p>Kipketer's time was later confirmed.</p>
</text>
